<Shell title="Utkal Store · coming together"><div class="wrap"><div class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">A Utkal Collective sub-project</p><h1>Carry a little<br/><em class="highlight">Odisha.</em></h1><p class="lead">Utkal Store is beginning with Utkal-branded T-shirts, jhula bags, coffee cups and water bottles: everyday objects with a sense of belonging.</p></div><div class="prose section" style="padding-top:0"><p>English and Odia designs will each have their own space. The first collection is being developed with planned supply through vendors in Bangalore.</p><p class="notice">Store concept in development. Products, pricing and ordering are not yet available.</p><h2>More than a souvenir.</h2><p>Our direction is a contemporary Odisha feeling, rooted in language, coastal colours and local stories. Flowers and fruits will become part of that vocabulary as their connections are researched.</p><p>The store will have its own commercial work and review process. Purchases will not influence encyclopedia coverage or editorial decisions.</p></div></div></Shell>
